('b8a8bf69-82d4-5130-a9ce-50f2a779ff5f', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'a3159ca9-af9c-407a-9d2b-1f70f0f4bf7b', 'a-level', '18.2', '9702 coursebook 18.2 · Observing oscillations', 37, 37, 'A student counts 30 oscillations of a pendulum in 36.6 s. Another student times 3 oscillations as 3.6 s. Both have a reaction-time uncertainty of 0.2 s. Calculate the percentage uncertainty in the period for the first student.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.5464', '%', false, NULL, false, NULL, '% uncertainty = 0.2 ÷ 36.6 × 100 = 0.55 % (the second student: 0.2 ÷ 3.6 × 100 = 5.6 %, ten times worse). Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: uncertainty/total time. C1: × 100. B1: comparison.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('cf5909b8-c693-569d-9f50-d7e3c82da49c', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'a3159ca9-af9c-407a-9d2b-1f70f0f4bf7b', 'a-level', '18.2', '9702 coursebook 18.2 · Observing oscillations', 38, 38, 'A student investigates how the period T of a mass–spring system depends on the mass m. Readings: m = 0.10, 0.20, 0.30, 0.40, 0.50 kg; T = 0.40, 0.56, 0.69, 0.80, 0.89 s. (a) Show that T² is proportional to m. (b) Determine the gradient of T² against m. (c) Calculate the spring constant. Give only the answer to (c).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '24.92', 'N m⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) T²/m: 0.40² ÷ 0.10 = 1.60, 0.56² ÷ 0.20 = 1.57, 0.69² ÷ 0.30 = 1.59, 0.80² ÷ 0.40 = 1.60, 0.89² ÷ 0.50 = 1.58 s² kg⁻¹: constant. (b) gradient ≈ 0.89² ÷ 0.50 = 1.58 s² kg⁻¹. (c) gradient = 4π²/k, so k = 4π² ÷ 1.584 = 24.9 N m⁻¹. Mark scheme (6 marks). M1: T²/m calculated for several points. A1: constant. C1: gradient. M1: gradient = 4π²/k. C1: substitution. A1: k = 24.9 N m⁻¹.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 438" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg8be0275a-t fg8be0275a-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg8be0275a-t">Period against mass</title><desc id="fg8be0275a-d">Table and graph of period against mass: m = 0.10, 0.20, 0.30, 0.40, 0.50 kg give T = 0.40, 0.56, 0.69, 0.80, 0.89 s.</desc><g transform="translate(0,0)"><rect x="137.4" y="8" width="125.1" height="168" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><rect x="137.4" y="8" width="125.1" height="28" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="171.3" y="22" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">m / kg</text><text x="233.9" y="22" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">T / s</text><line x1="205.2" y1="8" x2="205.2" y2="176" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="137.4" y1="36" x2="262.6" y2="36" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="171.3" y="50" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.10</text><text x="233.9" y="50" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.40</text><line x1="137.4" y1="64" x2="262.6" y2="64" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="171.3" y="78" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.20</text><text x="233.9" y="78" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.56</text><line x1="137.4" y1="92" x2="262.6" y2="92" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="171.3" y="106" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.30</text><text x="233.9" y="106" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.69</text><line x1="137.4" y1="120" x2="262.6" y2="120" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="171.3" y="134" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.40</text><text x="233.9" y="134" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.80</text><line x1="137.4" y1="148" x2="262.6" y2="148" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="171.3" y="162" font-size="14" text-anchor="midd