('c48e6dbe-76ee-581c-b924-8555c7567281', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 13, 13, 'A graph of velocity v against displacement x for s.h.m. has which shape?', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'An ellipse (a circle with suitable scales)', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v² = ω²(x₀² − x²) rearranges to x²/x₀² + v²/(ωx₀)² = 1: an ellipse. Mark scheme (1 mark). B1: C (An ellipse (a circle with suitable scales)).', 1, NULL, NULL),
('6e7dd36e-797e-5e34-b684-a6e268404bae', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 14, 14, 'At t = 0 an oscillator is at its maximum positive displacement. Which equation describes its motion?', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'x = x₀ cos ωt', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'cos 0 = 1, so x = x₀ cos ωt starts at x₀. Mark scheme (1 mark). B1: A (x = x₀ cos ωt).', 1, NULL, NULL),
('0bce8ac4-ffd1-5e1b-9501-bf3c3c7d8d5c', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 15, 15, 'An acceleration–time graph for s.h.m. has maximum value 9.0 m s⁻² and period 0.50 s. Calculate the amplitude of the motion.', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.05699', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'x₀ = a_max/ω² = 9.0 ÷ (2π ÷ 0.50)² = 0.0570 m. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: x₀ = a_max/ω². A1: x₀ = 0.0570 m.', 2, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg84dd6fe4-t fg84dd6fe4-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg84dd6fe4-t">Acceleration against time</title><desc id="fg84dd6fe4-d">Acceleration–time graph of s.h.m. with maximum value 9.0 m s⁻² and period 0.50 s.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="117.6" y1="34" x2="117.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="205.7" y1="34" x2="205.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="293.9" y1="34" x2="293.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="231.6" x2="382" y2="231.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="138" x2="382" y2="138" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;str