('c5d0819b-a010-5e47-bd62-53b768f59c5f', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 23, 23, 'An oscillator starts at x = 0 moving in the negative direction. Which describes its displacement–time graph?', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'An inverted sine curve, x = −x₀ sin ωt', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Starting at zero and going negative means x = −x₀ sin ωt. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: starts at zero, decreasing. A1: D (An inverted sine curve, x = −x₀ sin ωt).', 2, NULL, NULL),
('9025f506-ce21-5407-ae65-d957a311fd3f', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 24, 24, 'A displacement–time graph of s.h.m. has amplitude 4.0 cm and period 1.2 s. Calculate the gradient of the graph at the instant the displacement is 2.0 cm.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.1814', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'The gradient is the velocity: v = ω√(x₀² − x²) with ω = 2π ÷ 1.2 = 5.24 rad s⁻¹. v = 5.24 × √(0.040² − 0.020²) = 0.181 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (3 marks). B1: gradient = velocity. C1: ω = 2π/T. C1: v = ω√(x₀² − x²).', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgee056ab6-t fgee056ab6-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgee056ab6-t">Displacement against time</title><desc id="fgee056ab6-d">x–t graph of s.h.m. with amplitude 4.0 cm and period 1.2 s; a dashed line marks x = 2.0 cm.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="117.6" y1="34" x2="117.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="205.7" y1="34" x2="205.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="293.9" y1="34" x2="293.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="221.2" x2="382" y2="221.2" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-line