('67d33c3a-d910-5482-a12b-0a88e577edc0', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 25, 25, 'A velocity–time graph of s.h.m. is a sine curve starting from zero and increasing. What was the displacement at t = 0?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'A maximum in the negative direction (−x₀)', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = 0 at t = 0 so the object is at an extreme. v then becomes positive, so it is moving from −x₀ towards equilibrium. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v = 0 at an extreme. C1: moving in + direction from −x₀. A1: B (A maximum in the negative direction (−x₀)).', 3, NULL, NULL),
('11b913fc-db93-51c7-9d4e-0c3be4e8d08a', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 26, 26, 'A v–t graph for an oscillator has a maximum of 0.62 m s⁻¹, and the time between successive maxima is 0.45 s. Calculate the maximum acceleration.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '8.657', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'a_max = ω v_max = (2π ÷ 0.45) × 0.62 = 8.66 m s⁻². Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: ω = 2π/T. C1: a_max = ωv_max. A1: a_max = 8.66 m s⁻².', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg175cda0b-t fg175cda0b-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg175cda0b-t">Velocity against time</title><desc id="fg175cda0b-d">v–t graph with maxima of 0.62 m s⁻¹ that are 0.45 s apart.</desc><line x1="46.5" y1="34" x2="46.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="214.2" y1="34" x2="214.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="46.5" y1="224" x2="382" y2="224" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="46.5" y1="138" x2="382" y2="138" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="46.5" y1="52" x2="382" y2="52" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="46.5" y1="138" x2="388" y2="138" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stro