('7cc50b5d-dbf8-5451-b4cf-51df8229db8b', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 30, 30, 'A graph of acceleration against time for s.h.m. is a cosine curve starting at its maximum positive value. Where is the object at t = 0?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'At maximum negative displacement', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'a = −ω²x is maximum positive when x = −x₀. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: a = −ω²x. C1: a max positive ⇒ x = −x₀. A1: A (At maximum negative displacement).', 3, NULL, NULL),
('abe6eb39-7adb-5245-ad08-2aa3c596e560', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 31, 31, 'A velocity–displacement graph for an oscillator is an ellipse crossing the x-axis at ±5.0 cm and the v-axis at ±0.40 m s⁻¹. Calculate the period.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.7854', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'x₀ = 0.050 m and v_max = 0.40 m s⁻¹, so ω = v_max/x₀ = 0.40 ÷ 0.050 = 8.0 rad s⁻¹. T = 2π ÷ 8.0 = 0.785 s. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: read x₀ and v_max. C1: ω = v_max/x₀. C1: T = 2π/ω. A1: T = 0.785 s.', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgfa7ed7cc-t fgfa7ed7cc-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgfa7ed7cc-t">Velocity against displacement</title><desc id="fgfa7ed7cc-d">Velocity–displacement graph: an ellipse crossing the x-axis at ±5.0 cm and the v-axis at ±0.40 m s⁻¹.</desc><line x1="79.2" y1="34" x2="79.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="210.9" y1="34" x2="210.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="342.5" y1="34" x2="342.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="39.8" y1="218" x2="382" y2="218" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="39.8" y1="138" x2="382" y2="138" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="39.8" y1="58" x2="382" y2="58" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/