('3d738056-92a6-5072-bf67-7190e8dd0a9e', '70f5e4f8-856a-42b5-a2db-b89d66bae49a', 'cecb7488-b8aa-4ae3-af2a-d77c04d03414', 'a-level', '18.5', '9702 coursebook 18.5 · Representing s.h.m. graphically', 37, 37, 'A student sketches the kinetic energy–time graph of an s.h.m. of period T. What is the period of the kinetic energy graph?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'T/2', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Ek ∝ v², which is maximum twice per cycle (passing equilibrium in each direction), so Ek repeats every T/2. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: maximum twice per cycle. C1: T/2. A1: C (T/2).', 3, NULL, NULL),
